WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:32.269
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Hi, it’s me … Becca.

2
00:00:32.989 --> 00:00:34.679
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Hi. It’s the first floor.

3
00:00:45.398 --> 00:00:46.506
Come in.

4
00:00:47.863 --> 00:00:49.470
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Great flat, Dave.

5
00:00:49.774 --> 00:00:52.142
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Do you like it? It has nice kitchen.

6
00:00:52.558 --> 00:00:53.777
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Mmm. Nice smell.

7
00:00:54.414 --> 00:00:56.588
Er, where’s Dolly?

8
00:00:58.208 --> 00:01:00.881
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Dolly isn’t here.

9
00:01:01.698 --> 00:01:07.044
Em, Becca, I need to tell you something.

10
00:01:07.723 --> 00:01:10.479
Dolly isn’t my dog.

11
00:01:11.864 --> 00:01:13.470
She’s my friend’s dog.

12
00:01:14.426 --> 00:01:17.708
I sometimes help and take her for a walk.

13
00:01:18.207 --> 00:01:19.772
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> You don’t have a dog?

14
00:01:20.298 --> 00:01:23.920
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> No. I don’t like dogs much.

15
00:01:23.933 --> 00:01:25.492
And my flat’s quite small.

16
00:01:26.316 --> 00:01:29.155
So sorry. I know you love dogs.

17
00:01:30.006 --> 00:01:30.990
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Don’t worry!

18
00:01:31.862 --> 00:01:34.646
Barry isn’t my dog either!

19
00:01:35.103 --> 00:01:41.030
He’s my sister’s dog. I like dogs, but… in fact… I have two cats.

20
00:01:41.654 --> 00:01:43.260
How do you feel about cats?

21
00:01:43.281 --> 00:01:47.138
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> I love cats – in fact I prefer cats to dogs!

22
00:01:48.301 --> 00:01:49.991
Sit down. It’s nearly ready.

23
00:01:50.074 --> 00:01:50.850
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> What’s for lunch?

24
00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:53.155
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Pizza – and then chocolate ice cream.

25
00:01:53.315 --> 00:01:54.395
All home-made!

26
00:01:54.658 --> 00:01:55.766
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> All for me this time!